INSERT INTO chat_messages VALUES(6,'trades_dataset.csv-2025-09-19T04:09:15.756Z','model',unistr('```json\u000a{\u000a  "answer": "DeepDive has identified some common characteristics of your losing trades on EURUSD.lmax:\\n\\n### Characteristics of Losing EURUSD.lmax Trades:\\n\\nOut of 4 losing trades on EURUSD.lmax:\\n\\n*   **Open Hour Concentration:** All 4 losing trades (100%) were opened during the **16:00-16:59** hour window.\\n*   **Weekday Pattern:** 3 out of 4 losing trades (75%) occurred on a **Tuesday**.\\n*   **Trade Side:** 3 out of 4 losing trades (75%) were **SELL** trades.\\n*   **Duration:** 3 of the 4 losing trades were very short, closing within **4-9 minutes**.\\n\\n### Actionable Advice to Avoid Similar Setups:\\n\\nBased on this analysis, you should be extremely cautious or consider avoiding:\\n\\n*   **EURUSD.lmax SELL trades initiated on Tuesdays between 16:00 and 16:59**, especially those that are quick scalps or short-duration entries. This specific combination appears to be a significant money drain (contributing $-432.78 to losses from 3 trades).\\n*   While the 16:00-16:59 hour is your most profitable overall, it is also where **all** your EURUSD.lmax losses occurred. This suggests that while there''s opportunity, there''s also significant risk or specific market conditions in that hour that lead to losing setups on this instrument. Further investigation into your *winning* EURUSD trades in this window could reveal what makes them different."\u000a}\u000a```'),1,'2025-09-19 05:44:26','2025-09-19 05:44:26');
